# Azshara (54-54): the second Horde visit of Azshara, for a Horde duo: Magus Rimtori and the
# Thalassian Base Camp, Kim'jael, the Legashi Stronghold, the sharks and Lake Mennar.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/azshara_54_54.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Azshara, area 16). The
# guide's quest list is section 20 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the first visit of
# Azshara is in Burning Steppes & Azshara (51-52).
# Carried in: Magatha's Payment to Jediga (3562, from Thunder Bluff) and Jes'rimon's Payment to
# Jediga (3563, from Orgrimmar).
# Left to a later guide: Delivery to Andron Gant (3542, Undercity), for Felwood & Winterspring (54-56).
# Left out: Betrayed (3506): on WoW Forever, Betrayed (3505) leads to Seals of the Sin'dorei, An
# Explosive Gambit and Revenge Exacted instead (outof.games has no page for 3506 or 3507).
# Loramus (3141): it needs The Demon Hunter (2744), the end of a level 60 chain. The Twin Bears
# (92066): done inside the Blackmaw Hold dungeon. Demon Hunter's Hunter (91877): level 55 to take,
# handed in on Mount Hyjal, where no guide goes. Poisoned Water (6804) and Stormers and Rumblers
# (6805): level 55 to take, their objectives are in the Eastern Plaguelands and Silithus, and Duke
# Hydraxis is never visited again.
#
# The route: a flight from Orgrimmar to Valormok; Ursolan and Kim'jael; the Thalassian Base Camp,
# the seal bearers and Magus Rimtori; Korsa, the Legashi Stronghold and the sharks of the north
# coast; Kim'jael again, the Ruins of Eldarath and Lake Mennar; back by Kim'jael to Valormok;
# Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and a flight to Bloodvenom Post and the ride up to Timbermaw Hold.

guide Azshara (54-54)
faction horde
levels 54 54
carry 980 1123 3562 3563 3568 3909 5084 5159
leave 980 1123 3542 3568 3909 5084 5159
next Felwood & Winterspring (54-56)

# Orgrimmar ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
fly "Valormok, Azshara" npc 3310

# Valormok -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Azshara
turnin 3562 3563
accept 92346
tip Beneath Nordrassil is handed in to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff, at the end of this guide.
accept 3542
tip Delivery to Andron Gant goes to Undercity, for a later guide: keep the tablet in your bags.
accept 3505
accept 91685
accept 91611 skill Fishing
tip Kurll offers it only to those who know Fishing; the guide skips it otherwise. The Mammoth Sharks are level 56-57 elites: fight them together.

# Ursolan and Kim'jael -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 86798
tip Gatekeeper Rageroar's errand is handed in at Timbermaw Hold, at the end of this guide. If you skipped the Ursolan quests in Burning Steppes & Azshara (your Timbermaw standing was too low for the furbolgs), skip this one too, and Korsa's Thinning Their Forces and Later, Satyr: right-click each.
accept 3601
tip Kim'jael camps on top of the hill north of the blood elf camp.

# The Thalassian Base Camp and Magus Rimtori --------------------------------------------------------

do 3601 bg
tip Kim'jael's things are in the wooden boxes all over the camp. Many are empty, and they come back quickly.
do 3505.1
do 3505.2
do 3505.3 at 59.5,31.5 "Find Magus Rimtori's camp"
turnin 3505
accept 91497
tip The Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning lies by the tome you just read.
do 91497.2
tip Magister Hawkhelm stands in the middle of the base camp.
do 3601
do 91497.1
tip Lieutenant Suncrest holds the camp to the east.
do 91497.3
tip Ranger Lydrea is further east, on the bluff by the sea.
turnin 91497
accept 91500 91538
do 91500 at 59.5,31.4 "Use the Seals of the Sin'dorei by the arcane crystals, then kill Magus Rimtori"
tip Breaking the seals makes Rimtori appear. She is level 55 and comes with her guards.

# Korsa and the Legashi Stronghold -----------------------------------------------------------------

accept 86792
tip Korsa hides on the hill south-west of the stronghold.
do 86792 bg
accept 86796
tip Graal is locked in a cage at the north end of the stronghold.
do 86796 at 66.6,14.6 "Free Graal and escort him out of the stronghold"
do 86792
do 91611 at 65.9,6.1
tip The sharks swim far out off the north coast, where the sea floor drops away; a few more swim off the south-east coast (around 86,76). A Draught of Water Walking, a new Alchemy potion, makes them much easier to reach.
turnin 86792 86796

# Kim'jael, the Ruins of Eldarath and Lake Mennar ----------------------------------------------------

turnin 3601
accept 5534
do 5534 bg mobs 6195 6196 at 45.5,57.0
do 91685 at 40.4,80.8 "Use the Mana-Siphoning Wand on the Leyline Rift over Lake Mennar, then kill Celegosa for the Tear of Mennar"
tip Celegosa, a level 54 elite, swims in the lake.
do 5534 mobs 6195 6196 at 45.5,57.0
tip Every Spitelash naga of the Ruins of Eldarath can drop the rune, but rarely: the Sirens and Myrmidons are the most numerous.
turnin 5534

# Valormok -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 91500
accept 91531
turnin 91538
accept 91547
turnin 91685
turnin 91611
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 8610

# Orgrimmar ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
turnin 91531
tip Belgrom Rockmaul is in the Valley of Honor.
turnin 91547
tip Zevrost is in the Cleft of Shadow. His next task, Vek'zol, is in the Blasted Lands: no guide takes it.
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Druids and paladins train in Thunder Bluff, the next stop.
fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 3310

# Thunder Bluff ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Thunder Bluff
turnin 92346
tip Nara Wildmane is on Elder Rise. Her next task is done inside the Blackmaw Hold dungeon.
train 3033 246344
fly "Bloodvenom Post, Felwood" npc 2995

# Timbermaw Hold -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Felwood
goto "Ride north along the road to Timbermaw Hold" at 64.8,8.1 r 30
tip Nafien guards the mouth of the furbolg tunnel.
turnin 86798
tip Gorn One Eye stands inside the hold, along the tunnel.
note "Azshara is done: the next guide, Felwood & Winterspring, goes on from Timbermaw Hold" npc 11555
